OL,3,GNEWSAMinimum wage rises affecting
OL,4,Aentry-level roles
OL,5,
OL,6,FCompanies say increases to the minimum
OL,7,Fwage are making it harder to recruit
OL,8,Ffor entry-level jobs as it's becoming
OL,9,F"increasingly difficult to justify
OL,10,Fcreating roles for inexperienced
OL,11,Fworkers", a survey has found.
OL,13,FThe Jersey Chamber of Commerce employer
OL,14,Fsurvey was put to businesses in
OL,15,Fhospitality, retail, construction,
OL,16,Fprofessional services, financial
OL,17,Fservices, agriculture, care and
OL,18,Ftransport.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
