OL,3,GNEWSAMinimum wage rises affecting
OL,4,Aentry-level roles
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt revealed a "growing concern" over
OL,7,Fthe impact of the minimum wage
OL,8,Fincreases on business sustainability,
OL,9,Frecruitment and employment
OL,10,Fopportunities for young people.
OL,12,FAt the start of September, economic
OL,13,Fdevelopment minister deputy Gerald
OL,14,FVoisin said the current #13.59 per hour
OL,15,Fwas too high for some sectors.
